Package: shinyGovBRstyle
Title: Custom GovBR Style Inputs for Shiny
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
  given = "Rodrigo", 
  family = "Borges", 
  email = "apps@distintive.com.br", 
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny user interface components implementing the official
    Brazilian GovBR Design System (https://www.gov.br/ds/home). The br_*
    family wraps the GovBR DS assets (CSS, JavaScript and Rawline font),
    served locally so applications work offline, and integrates with
    native Shiny input bindings. Started as a fork of the UK shinyGovstyle
    package; its legacy GOV.UK-derived functions are deprecated.
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
